      ],
      "key": "admission_contract_binding",
      "statement": "Contract application binds authoritative current basis, complete design relation and commit unit, required support, actual admitter grant and supported durable/other outcome; these are semantic bindings, not a new carrier or validation pass. Apply UP-021's reason-sensitive admission map, including predecessor continuity/currentness/grant joins, missing/stale/incompatible/unusable distinctions, trust-boundary validation and separate assessment/decision/observed-commit predicates. Preserve qualified domain outcome, nonperformance, partial publication and unknown effects. Well-formedness is a different predicate. Shape-correct projection candidates need authentic current-predecessor evidence and actual grants, which alone do not prove other conditions. Unresolved seams use UP-017 affected sets; basis advancement before semantic commit prevents the effect and requires current-basis re-entry.",
