      "key": "ontology_projection_preservation",
      "statement": "Faithful projection binds accepted Ontology and its identity, relationship, lifecycle, authority, function/effect laws to domain/class, sequence/state views; authority/effect matrices; IACS; public APIs/registers/SDK/CLI; schemas/codecs/manifests/catalogs; architecture/modules; and implementation/test/proof inventories through accepted design and requirements. Bindings name source and preserved laws. Structural HOW cannot originate rival semantics; untraceable operations/messages/transitions/carriers/effects cannot enter the active line.",
